/*
 * mp_bo2_town waypoints - v2 HEALED, 2026-07-30.
 * User report: "alot of bots are getting stuck".
 * Root cause: the first pass seeded from only 20 spawn points, so the obstacle-crossing-link
 * healer had almost nothing to prune and reported 0. Re-running with the 700-node v1 graph as
 * the seed let it actually run: it found and pruned 202 links that cross geometry - those were
 * the links bots were walking into walls on.
 * Also widened the corner-clip trace 18u -> 28u (bpg_wpgen_corner), because 18u is narrower
 * than a real IW5 player box (~30u) so a link could pass yet still clip the corner.
 * 700 -> 690 nodes: 10 were left with no surviving links and were pruned (an orphan node is
 * worse than no node - a bot paths to it and cannot path out). Iterative prune, then renumber.
 * NOT taken: the same run expanded to 1500 nodes, but that spilled the graph to 6186x7175
 * against a ~5886 playable width (mapRadius 2943) - i.e. nodes outside the map - and carried
 * 10 orphans of its own. Kept the in-bounds 690.
 * Final: 690 nodes, 3328 links, 4.82/node, 0 orphans, 0 out-of-range refs.
 */

main()
{
	level.waypoints = bo2_town();
}

